# EXHALE resolved configuration (machine-readable).
# Values in effect after input.inp + base.inp resolution;
# these are what the wind solver uses, and what
# EXHALE_transit.py should use instead of input.inp.
# Reals are written to full double precision so a budget
# check can use them without a round-off floor.
